  "title": "How is it going recently?",
  "russian_title": "Как дела́ в после́днее вре́мя?",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "how-is-it-going-recently",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/14204_how-is-it-going-recently.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: Teacher Li, long time no see!",
    "B: Lele’s mother, long time no see!",
    "A: How is Lele doing at school recently?",
    "B: He likes to help everyone, and his classmates also like him very much, but his studies have been so-so recently.",
    "A: He doesn’t study hard and likes to watch TV every day when he comes home.",
    "B: Watching too much TV is not good.",
    "A: Yes. I told him, but he didn't listen.",
    "",
    "A: Great! Thank you, Teacher Li."
  ],
  "english_full": "A: Teacher Li, long time no see!\n\nB: Lele’s mother, long time no see!\n\nA: How is Lele doing at school recently?\n\nB: He likes to help everyone, and his classmates also like him very much, but his studies have been so-so recently.\n\nA: He doesn’t study hard and likes to watch TV every day when he comes home.\n\nB: Watching too much TV is not good.\n\nA: Yes. I told him, but he didn't listen.\n\n\n\nA: Great! Thank you, Teacher Li.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "А: Наста́вник Ли, давненько не ви́делися!",
    "Б: Ма́ма Леле, давненько не ви́делися!",
    "А: Как у Леле́ дела́ в шко́ле в после́днее вре́мя?",
    "Б: Он по́хочет помога́ть всем, и его́ однокла́ссники то́же о́чень его́ любят, но в те́чение неда́внего вре́мени его́ уче́ба сре́дненькая.",
    "А: Он не у́чит́ся усердно и лю́бит смотре́ть ТВ каждыи́ день, когда́ приходи́т до́ма.",
    "Б: Смотре́ть сли́шком мно́го ТВ нехоро́шо.",
    "А: Да. Я ска́зал ему́, но он не послу́шал.",
    "",
    "А: Замеча́тельно! Спаси́бо, наста́вник Ли."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: Nastávnik Li, davn'en'ko ne vid'elis'!",
    "B: Máma Lele, davn'en'ko ne vid'elis'!",
    "A: Kak u Lelé delá v shkóle v posled'nee vrem'a?",
    "B: On pókhochet pomogá't' vsem, i egó odnoklássniki tôzhe óchen' egó liúbat, no v téchenie nedávnego vrem'eni egó uchéba srédnen'kaya.",
    "A: On ne úchit's'a usérdno i liúbit smotret' TV kazhdyi den', kogdá prikhod'it dómá.",
    "B: Smotrét' slíshkom mnógo TV nekhórosho.",
    "A: Da. Ya skázal yemú, no on ne poslúshal.",
    "",
    "A: Zamechá'tel'no! Spasíbo, nastávnik Li."
  ],
